4,"^H",4,536873150]],["^15",[54,"^;","~u673090c8-da4b-4267-b981-4c96fc8d3892",536870921]],["^15",[61,"^3","* Create [[logseq]] plugin `cycle-todo-dwim`\n** DONE Setup repo for `cycle-todo-dwim` plugin with \"hello world\" command\n** DONE Setup playwright testing in `cycle-todo-dwim` plugin repo\n** DONE Setup `npm init logseq-plugin` as https://github.com/microsoft/create-playwright\n** DONE Add test to verify `cycle-todo-dwim` functionality\n** DONE Backport the fix for electron tests to `logseq-sample-plugin`\n** DONE Setup eslint for `logseq-cycle-todo-dwim`\n** DONE Setup `prettier-eslint`for `logseq-cycle-todo-dwim`\n** DONE Implement `cycle-todo-dwim`\n** DONE Setup CI with linting and format checking\n** TODO Add logo for `cycle-todo-dwim` plugin\n** Add README with description of functionality\n** Switch to node.js 18\n** TODO Install `cycle-todo-dwim` and test it for a few days\n** Setup releasing github actions\n** Publish `cycle-todo-dwim`\n** Port eslint setup to `logseq-sample-plugin`\n** Add 'Skip DOING/NOW option'\n* TODO Fix tray icon colors for [[ytmdesktop]]\n* TODO Reconfigure Nastya's Kindle to have her account\n* TODO Fix restoring the cursors after rescheduling a todo from the journal page in [[logseq]]\n* Migrate my laptop and phone\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** DONE Install Ubuntu or NixOS on the desktop\n** DONE Install clean Ubuntu on the laptop\n** DONE Wait for a return package for the laptop\n** DONE Pack the laptop for sending\n** TODO Drop the package with laptop at Posti #outside\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-29 Fri>\nDEADLINE: <2024-11-29 Fri>\n** DONE Buy new smartphone\nDEADLINE: <2024-11-29 Fri -1w>\n** DONE Wait for a new smartphone to arrive to K-Market\n** DONE Pick up the new smartphone from K-Market :outside:\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-12 Tue>\n\nHei!\n\nSinulle on tullut lähetys.\n\nNoutopaikka: Postin automaatti, K-Market Aurinkolahti, Leikosaarentie 48, Helsinki\nViimeinen noutopäivä: 17.11.\n\nLähettäjä: DNA OYJ\nLähetystunnus: JJFI60527700460348853\n\nLokerokoodi 434315\n** DONE Migrate to the new smartphone\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-12 Tue>\nDEADLINE: <2024-12-01 Sun>\n** DONE Contact AP about delivering the old phone and maybe the laptop to Forenom on Wednesday\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-13 Wed>\n** DONE Ensure OP bank works on the new smartphone\n** DONE Ensure Nordea bank works on the new smartphone\n** DONE Ensure all the brokers work on the new smartphone\n** DONE Check all the other apps on the new smartphone\n** DONE Disable access for OP bank on the old smartphone\n** DONE Disable access for Nordea bank on the old smartphone\n** DONE Setup syncthing on the new phone\n** DONE Add the new phone to ananke syncthing\n** DONE Remove the old phone from ananke syncthing\n** DONE Delete everything on the old smartphone using some howto properly\n** DONE Return the smartphone to Forenom #outside \nDEADLINE: <2024-12-02 Mon -1w>\n* TODO Create `convert-todo-to-block` [[logseq]] plugin\n* Add Ctrl+Space shortcut to [[logseq]]\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** DONE Make Ctrl+Enter to switch DOING -> TODO and reschedule repeating tasks\n** DONE Ask for review of my PR for Ctrl+Space\n** DONE Change ctrl+space to just space for toggle-checked\n** TODO Wait for a review of PR for Ctrl+Space\n** Use the latest `master` for [[logseq]]\n* Buy the [[health insurance]]\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** DONE Provide additional information about anemia and urinary inflammation to OP\nDEADLINE: <2024-11-26 Tue> SCHEDULED: <2024-11-06 Wed>\n** DONE Try to print as PDF all my visits from omakanta and send them to OP\nDEADLINE: <2024-11-26 Tue>\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-15 Fri>\n** TODO Wait for the decision about my health insurance from OP\n** TODO Reapply for my health insurance when all my visits to doctor are not relevant anymore\nSCHEDULED: <2025-08-31 Sun>\n* TODO Wait for a response from Residential and Commercial Property Information System about my apartment's registration\nDEADLINE: <2025-05-09 Fri>\n* Fix `diffEditor.revertBlock` for assigning it to a keyboard shortcut in vscode\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** DONE Allow to run `diffEditor.revertBlock` from the original editor as well\n** DONE Create an issue and PR for `diff-editor-revert-keyboard-fix`\n** DONE Rebase my PR `diff-editor-revert-keyboard-fix` to fix the merge conflicts\n** TODO Wait for review and merge of `diff-editor-revert-keyboard-fix`\n* TODO Make discard hit commit command to be available as keyboard shortcut on vscode\n* TODO Pay the last part of back taxes for 2023\nSCHEDULED: <2024-12-01 Sun>\nDEADLINE: <2025-01-03 Fri -1m>\n* TODO Decide If we need to buy glasses for me or Nastya\nSCHEDULED: <2024-12-01 Sun>\nDEADLINE: <2024-12-26 Thu -1m>\n* TODO Define next actions to visit oculist\n* TODO Research a weird multi cursors edits in #zed\n* TODO Fix automatic theme switching in Logseq on Android\n* TODO Make PageUp/PageDown to in [[logseq]]. They should move the cursor to the first block of the next/prev pages\n* TODO Add a keyboard shortcut to go to the page with the block in [[logseq]]\n* TODO Create an extension for vscode and/or zed to support Jetbrains requests file (.http file extension)\n* TODO Create a [[logseq]] plugin to properly show agenda: day by day\n* TODO Create modus operandi/vivendi theme for logseq\n* TODO Add a keyboard shortcut for [[logseq]] to open a link in the block\n* TODO Create a plugin for [[logseq]] to render a progressbar like in org-mode\n* TODO Create Gnome extension just like devilspie2\n* DONE Pick up the package from Columbus (eToro)\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-24 Sun>\nDEADLINE: <2024-12-01 Sun>\n* TODO Add Firefox to Steam Deck\n* DONE Install air humidifiers #outside\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-25 Mon>\n* TODO Find a plugin or command in [[logseq]] to toggle showing completed todos\n* DONE Escort Elena from Eira to home\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-25 Mon>\n* DONE Take out all the pillows\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-25 Mon>\n* DONE Go to Columbus #outside\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-26 Tue>\n** DONE Лекарства (Burana и Tamal)\n** DONE Jääpikkaa/ukko bread\n** DONE Reissumies bread\n** DONE Kaurajuoma (не kahvia)\n** DONE Молоко синее\n* DONE Help Elena to migrate to Firefox\n* TODO Escort Elena to Eira for an inspection\nSCHEDULED: <2024-12-09 Mon 11:00>\n* TODO Check Firefox source code and find out why it doesn't translate to Russian\n* TODO Install codium with my patches\n* TODO Buy Greenfield in the Estonian shop #outside\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-29 Fri>\n* TODO Buy groceries in k-market #outside\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-29 Fri>\n** TODO Черника\n** TODO Помидоры\n** TODO Салат зелёный\n** TODO Kahvin kaurajuoma\n** TODO Dumblee breakfast",536873194]],["^15",[61,"^17",1731236040288,536870921]],["^15",[61,"^2:","~m1732796155791",536873193]],["^15",[61,"^Z","pages/Tasks.org",536870921]],["^15",[62,"^K",1731236040286,536870921]],["^15",[62,"^[",61,536870921]],["^15",[62,"^@",false,536870921]],["^15",[62,"^Y","tasks",536870921]],["^15",[62,"^11","Tasks",536870921]],["^15",[62,"^B",1732790717192,536873188]],["^15",[62,"^;","~u67483564-4892-4a28-8c75-ade2b4530d78",536873153]],["^15",[92,"^3","* TODO Change my toothbrush\nSCHEDULED: <2024-12-01 Sun .+3m>\n* TODO My Brother Birthday\nSCHEDULED: <2025-03-25 Tue .+1y>\n* TODO Define next actions to redo vaccination against tetanus every 20 years\nSCHEDULED: <2027-10-14 Thu .+20y>\n* TODO Review GTD system weekly\nSCHEDULED: <2024-11-30 Sat +1w>\n:LOGBOOK:\n- State \"DONE\" from \"TODO\" [2024-11-07 Thu 08:45]\n- State \"DONE\" from \"TODO\" [2024-11-24 Sun 10:42]\n:END:\n* TODO Replace ISS in the humidifiers\nSCHEDULED: <2025-01-30 Thu .+1y>\n* TODO Sort all warranty documents and trash the ones we don't need anymore\nSCHEDULED: <2026-01-06 Tue .+1y>\n* TODO Top up the Telia prepaid sim\nSCHEDULED: <2025-02-23 Sun .+4m>\n* Taxes\n:PROPERTIES:\n:END:\n** TODO Fill Bitcoin and Ethereum taxes for 1st quarter\nSCHEDULED: <2025-04-01 Tue .+1y>\n** TODO Fill Bitcoin and Ethereum taxes for 